{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.546797+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.693989+00:00", "id": 23741681, "conceptrecid": "23741680", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "metadata": {"title": "From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Road Transport Electrification in Colombia \u2014 GAMS Model and Replication Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Reproducibility archive for the study \"From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Energy and Macroeconomic Effects of Road Transport Electrification Policies in Colombia\".</p>\n<p>This repository contains a recursive-dynamic computable general equilibrium (CGE) model integrated with a vehicle technology-choice and fleet-turnover module for Colombia. The model is calibrated to a 2024 social accounting matrix and simulates the period 2025&ndash;2048.</p>\n<p>The replication package includes the GAMS model, calibration data, six policy scenarios (E0&ndash;E5), 15 sensitivity experiments (S01&ndash;S15), simulation results, solver diagnostics, and a mathematical specification of the CGE model in English.</p>\n<p>The repository also provides a Python postprocessing script to reconstruct physical road transport energy consumption separately from the monetary energy valuation used within the CGE model.</p>\n<p>The simulations were executed using GAMS 53.5.1 and CONOPT. Reproducing the model requires a valid GAMS installation and license. All central scenarios and sensitivity experiments can be executed from the main run.gms file.</p>\n<p>The original model code is distributed under the MIT License, while the data, simulation results, and documentation are distributed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Rodriguez Avila, Jesus Eduardo", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0009-0005-5714-6419"}, {"name": "Botero Garc\u00eda, Jes\u00fas Alonso", "affiliation": "Comestibles DAN", "orcid": "0000-0001-9821-7221"}, {"name": "Hurtado Rendon, Alvaro Arturo", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-6973-1966"}, {"name": "Osorio-G\u00f3mez, Gilberto", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-8760-3335"}, {"name": "Giraldo Galindo, Michael Daniel", "affiliation": "Universidad EAFIT", "orcid": "0000-0002-4967-4909"}], "keywords": ["Transport electrification", "Computable general equilibrium", "Vehicle fleet turnover", "Electric vehicles", "Energy demand", "Colombia", "GAMS"], "version": "1.0.0.", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "gams", "title": {"en": "GAMS"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23741680"}}]}}, "title": "From Vehicle Sales to the Fleet: Road Transport Electrification in Colombia \u2014 GAMS Model and Replication Data", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23741681", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741680", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741680", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23741680", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23741681/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23741681/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23741681/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-28T19:25:33.693989+00:00", "recid": "23741681", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "58e426ec-5d64-4fd8-b009-202fd42089cb", "key": "Road_Transport_Electrification_Colombia.zip", "size": 2559597, "checksum": "md5:711c663ea24c32ea22a97c0000b637f3", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23741681/files/Road_Transport_Electrification_Colombia.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1972644"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 4, "unique_downloads": 4, "views": 5, "unique_views": 5, "version_downloads": 4, "version_unique_downloads": 4, "version_unique_views": 5, "version_views": 5}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-28T19:17:21.392078+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T19:17:21.728518+00:00", "id": 23741826, "conceptrecid": "23741825", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741825", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package: Change Relevance, Not Description Semantics. A large-scale empirical evaluation of semantic test case prioritisation on real continuous integration data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23741826", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Replication package for S. Ndlovu, E. Mnkandla and M. Ramachandran, \"Change Relevance, Not Description Semantics: A Large-Scale Empirical Evaluation of Semantic Test Case Prioritisation on Real Continuous Integration Data\" (manuscript). The study evaluates logistic regression, a random forest and the CIOM convolutional network on real CI data, with and without a description-based semantic score and BM25 change relevance, over three seeds and two evaluation protocols, and uses identity controls to separate the meaning of the semantic score from its ability to identify individual tests.</p>\n<p>The archive contains the experiment harness (train_evaluate_p2.py, with the feature configurations and identity controls), the lists of every run, the analysis scripts, the per-cycle scores and run manifest of every run, and the analysis outputs behind Tables 2-7 and Figure 1 of the paper. The study uses the CIOM-CI dataset, which is archived separately and is not included here: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23478324. See README.md and README_paper2.md (inside the zip) for the folder layout and commands. Code is released under the MIT licence; results files under CC BY 4.0.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ndlovu, Siqabukile", "affiliation": "National University of Science and Technology"}, {"name": "Mnkandla, Ernest", "affiliation": "University of South Africa"}, {"name": "Ramachandran, Muthu", "affiliation": "University of South Africa"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.23478324", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1145/3395363.3397383", "relation": "isD