mplementation of LoopLearner with the predictions of its 180 runs; and the checks on versions 2 and 3 of LOOPerSet. README.md maps each result to its files and gives the commands to recompute or retrain it.</p>\n<p>LORE's loop bodies are not included: the original database is no longer hosted by its authors and its license could not be determined. LOOPerSet is distributed by its authors.</p>\n<p>Code is under the MIT license, and the data and results derived by the authors under CC BY 4.0. Measurements taken from LORE remain subject to its terms.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Anonymous", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["compiler optimization", "machine learning", "loop transformations", "data leakage", "code duplication", "evaluation methodology"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1109/IISWC.2017.8167779", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "arXiv:2510.10209", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "arxiv"}], "dates": [{"type": "submitted"}], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23656858"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package for \"Measuring What Learned Compiler Optimization Really Gains\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23656859", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23656859", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23656859?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23656859", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23656859", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23656859", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23656859/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23656858", "parent_html": "ht